<h1>🏨 Guest Room Module: Technical Reference Manual</h1>
<p>This document provides a detailed technical breakdown of the Guest Room Module, including database schemas, stored procedures, and operational logic flows.</p>

<hr/>

<h2>1. Database Schema (Tables)</h2>

<h3>📊 RoomReservations</h3>
<p>The primary table for tracking all bookings and financial advances.</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>ReservationNo</b> (PK): Unique ID for the booking (e.g., RES000106).</li>
    <li><b>GroupResNo</b>: Links multiple rooms under one booking group.</li>
    <li><b>GuestName</b>: Name of the primary guest.</li>
    <li><b>ReservationType</b>: Guest, Member, or Affiliated.</li>
    <li><b>FromDate / ToDate</b>: Planned stay period.</li>
    <li><b>NoOfRooms</b>: Number of rooms requested.</li>
    <li><b>AdvancePayment</b>: Payment made at the time of booking.</li>
    <li><b>Status</b>: Static status (Pending, Confirmed, Occupied, Completed, Cancelled).</li>
    <li><b>ReceiptNo</b>: Financial reference for the advance payment.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🔑 RoomAllocations</h3>
<p>Tracks the actual physical occupancy of rooms.</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>AllocationID</b> (PK): Auto-increment ID.</li>
    <li><b>ReservationNo</b> (FK): Links back to the reservation.</li>
    <li><b>RoomNo</b>: The physical room number (e.g., 008).</li>
    <li><b>AllocatedDate</b>: The exact time of check-in.</li>
    <li><b>CheckOutDate</b>: The exact time of check-out (NULL if still occupied).</li>
    <li><b>StayFactor</b>: Multiplier for billing (1.0 for full day, 0.5 for half day).</li>
    <li><b>RFIDDeactive</b>: Tracking for electronic key status.</li>
</ul>

<h3>📜 GR_Bills</h3>
<p>Stores finalized invoices and mid-stay payments.</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>BillNo</b> (PK): Invoice number or payment reference (e.g., INV-1001 or ADV-MID-xxx).</li>
    <li><b>ReservationNo</b>: The associated booking.</li>
    <li><b>TotalRoomRent</b>: Total calculated rent.</li>
    <li><b>TaxPercent / TaxAmount</b>: GST details.</li>
    <li><b>OtherCharges</b>: Sum of all service/facility charges.</li>
    <li><b>AmountPaid</b>: Payment received during settlement.</li>
    <li><b>BillStatus</b>: Settled, Draft, or Refunded.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🛠️ GR_RoomServices</h3>
<p>Audit trail for daily charges (Rent, GST, Facilities).</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>ServiceID</b> (PK): Unique ID.</li>
    <li><b>ReservationNo</b>: Associated booking.</li>
    <li><b>ServiceName</b>: Description (e.g., "Room Rent (Automatic) - 22-Apr").</li>
    <li><b>TotalAmount</b>: The cost of the service.</li>
    <li><b>Status</b>: 'Pending' until included in a finalized bill.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🛌 RoomDefinitionNew</h3>
<p>Inventory of physical rooms.</p>
<ul>
    <li><b>RoomNo</b> (PK): Room number.</li>
    <li><b>Rent</b>: Default daily rate.</li>
    <li><b>Status</b>: Clean, Dirty, Maintenance, or Occupied.</li>
</ul>

<hr/>

<h2>2. Stored Procedures (Logic Layers)</h2>

<h3>⚙️ sp_InsertRoomReservation</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Purpose</b>: Creates new rows in RoomReservations.</li>
    <li><b>Inputs</b>: All guest details, dates, and advance payment.</li>
    <li><b>Outputs</b>: @NewReservationNo, @NewReceiptNo.</li>
    <li><b>Logic</b>: Increments the reservation counter and generates a financial receipt for the advance.</li>
</ul>

<h3>⚙️ sp_GR_GetReservationForBill</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Purpose</b>: Fetches all data required to generate an invoice.</li>
    <li><b>Logic</b>: Joins RoomReservations, RoomAllocations, and GR_Bills to find weighted nights and existing payments.</li>
</ul>

<h3>⚙️ sp_GR_SaveBill</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Purpose</b>: Finalizes the guest account.</li>
    <li><b>Inputs</b>: Final counts for rooms/nights, taxes, and payments.</li>
    <li><b>Outputs</b>: @BillNo, @NetBalance, @PayBack.</li>
    <li><b>Logic</b>: Marks all 'Pending' service charges as 'Settled' and updates the reservation status.</li>
</ul>

<h3>⚙️ sp_GR_NightAudit</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Purpose</b>: Daily automation of billing.</li>
    <li><b>Logic</b>: Runs every midnight. Loops through all RoomAllocations where CheckOutDate IS NULL and inserts new records into GR_RoomServices for that day's Rent and GST.</li>
</ul>

<hr/>

<h2>3. Operational Logic Flows</h2>

<h3>🔄 Reservation & Check-In Flow</h3>
<ol>
    <li><b>Reservation</b>: User saves booking -> sp_InsertRoomReservation called -> Row added to RoomReservations.</li>
    <li><b>Check-In</b>: User selects room -> RoomCheckIn.aspx -> Row added to RoomAllocations with CheckOutDate = NULL -> RoomDefinitionNew.Status set to 'Occupied'.</li>
    <li><b>Real-Time Status</b>: Dashboard queries RoomAllocations. If a record exists with NULL checkout, the UI shows OCCUPIED regardless of the static status column.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔄 Stay Extension Flow</h3>
<ol>
    <li>User selects "Edit" in RoomReservation.aspx.</li>
    <li>LoadReservationForEdit populates the form.</li>
    <li>User changes ToDate and clicks "Save".</li>
    <li><b>Availability Check</b>: System queries RoomReservations for the new date range, EXCLUDING the current ReservationNo.</li>
    <li><b>Update</b>: System performs an UPDATE on the existing row in RoomReservations instead of an INSERT.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔄 Check-Out & Billing Flow</h3>
<ol>
    <li><b>Check-Out</b>: User releases room -> RoomAllocations.CheckOutDate updated to GETDATE() -> Room set to 'Dirty'.</li>
    <li><b>Billing</b>: User searches ReservationNo in ManageBills.aspx.</li>
    <li><b>Validation</b>: IsCheckoutAllowed checks if CheckOutDate is not null for any room in the group.</li>
    <li><b>Aggregation</b>: System sums all AdvancePayment from RoomReservations + all ADV-MID payments from GR_Bills.</li>
    <li><b>Finalization</b>: User clicks "Finalize" -> sp_GR_SaveBill processes the transaction -> All service charges marked as 'Settled'.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔄 Night Audit Flow (Automated)</h3>
<ol>
    <li><b>Trigger</b>: SQL Agent Job runs at 12:05 AM.</li>
    <li><b>Query</b>: Finds all rooms in RoomAllocations where CheckOutDate is NULL.</li>
    <li><b>Posting</b>: 
        <ul>
            <li>Inserts "Room Rent (Automatic)" into GR_RoomServices.</li>
            <li>Inserts "GST on Room Rent" into GR_RoomServices.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><b>Result</b>: Guest Ledger shows the new balance immediately.</li>
</ol>

<hr/>
<p style="text-align: center; color: #777;">Technical Manual Version: 2.0 (April 2026)</p>

</body>
</html>
